PufferTank 5.0 (CUDA V13.0.88)
pufferl: scalar value reads the delay summary
pufferl: r40 shared scalar recurrent value head
pufferl: joint KL gate 1.000 nat (actor stops, shared value row continues)
pufferl: tanh-squash on (noise inside tanh; log-prob at the pre-tanh sample)
pufferl: squash chain floor 0.250 (0 is exact)
pufferl: advantage normalization on (mean/var over the whole rollout)
pufferl: learning-reward clamp off (train.rew_clamp = 0.000)
smart_buildings: zone memory on (anticipation from the observation)
smart_buildings: canonical layout (983 obs, 219 continuous heads), absolute actions
smart_buildings: group 1/1, weather 0: 128 envs, episode length 8640 steps, /art/sets/r44_fairbanks_atlanta/building_train_1__atlanta_2.sbb
smart_buildings: group 1/1, weather 1: 128 envs, episode length 8640 steps, /art/sets/r44_fairbanks_atlanta/building_train_1__fairbanks_1.sbb
smart_buildings: group 1/1: 256 envs, 2 scenario(s), ld 256, 8 env(s)/lane, value mode 2
smart_buildings: trajectory /res/study_r44/trajectory.bin (256 envs, 5 reward parts)
smart_buildings: mask 1/1: 97/288 active heads
